From: lkshrk <dev@harke.me>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 08:50:10 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add omp as a target, with Codex, approve and outdated
 fixes

omp gets native MCP ownership, per-server targets, extensions and portable hooks. Owned self-defined Codex connections keep local preferences, foreign Codex entries match correctly, apm approve grants apply at install and to native extensions, and apm outdated takes --json.
